<title>TRINIDAD AND TOBAGO: CRICKET-INDIA 367-3 V WEST INDIES (296), SECOND TEST - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 367-3 V WEST INDIES (296), SECOND TEST - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>PORT OF SPAIN, Trinidad 1997-03-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>India were</p>
<p>367-3, replying to West Indies' first innings score of 296, a</p>
<p>lead of 71, at the close on the third day of the second test at</p>
<p>the Queen's Park Oval on Sunday.</p>
</text>
